From 72c8d7da46560bbf03cb406aac27112094a61491 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:33:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): restore full Panacode branding (splash, logos,
 icons)

Replace OpenCode splash wordmark, installer icons, About/home logos,
window titles, menus, protocols, and About copy with Panacode identity
so packaged Windows builds no longer look like stock OpenCode.
